        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-15T15:01:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that\u0027s forbidden because the guest will have some hard-coded expectations about the order. Actually, if it doesn\u0027t, it\u0027s because of [`\u003creg-names\u003e`](https://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/latest/source/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/resource-names.txt) which makes things even more complicated to validate ... For now, we could at least forbid (in the guidelines) the use of that binding in VM DTBOs.",
      "parentUuid": "ab73ed50_7c01670b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 355,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 365,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "1419284e25ab06b9283a680d12bed7258a3f18b2",
