      "writtenOn": "2023-12-18T08:11:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\n\nI have follow-up questions:\n\n- Question) Can multiple devices share the same `\u003creg\u003e` in `/host`? Overlapping looks bad, but not sure whether there can be an exact match `\u003creg\u003e`.\n- Question) Should `pvmfw` validate all VM DTBO\u0027s `/host` `\u003creg\u003e`, including unassigned one? I think yes, but just to double check.\n- Question) Can I assume that hypervisor is always correct? I\u0027m asking this to know whether I can skip `\u003creg\u003e`/`\u003ciommus\u003e` overlapping check for the input DT. If VM DTBO\u0027s `/host` doesn\u0027t have overlapping `\u003creg\u003e` nor conflicting `\u003ciommus\u003e`, then overlaps in input DT would fails in `validate_reg()` / `validate_iommus()`. No explicit check is needed for input DT if so.",
      "parentUuid": "66a16e37_365e1abb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 355,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 365,
        "endChar": 17
